      "content": "Given the combination of chest pressure and arm numbness, even if it feels like a dull ache, you must seek immediate medical attention. Taking unprescribed medication or over-the-counter pain relievers without a doctor's assessment can mask serious symptoms. Please understand that it is never safe to ignore chest discomfort that comes with other neurological symptoms like numbness. Call 911 or go to the ER immediately to ensure your safety.",
