      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i hear what ur saying but i'm literally at work right now and i cant just drop everything. i've had bad panic attacks before where i felt exactly like this and i just slept it off. if i just stay very still and take a deep breath, can i just wait and see if it passes in an hour or so? is it really that much of a big deal if it's just stress-related tightness? i'm mostly just worried about something being wrong with my heart.",
